WEBVTT

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.380
<b>My Stepmom's 
Daughter Is 
My Ex</b>

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:59.430
<b>Youthful Indiscretion</b>

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.010
Irido

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.520
I-I'm a little nervous.

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.860
<i>I'll have the house to myself tomorrow.</i>

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:17.060
This is my first time in a guy's room.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:21.340
This is my first time having 
a girl in my room too.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:25.490
Don't ever bring another girl 
over, okay? I'll be mad.

00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:30.500
Well, have a seat.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.970
<i>But the only place to sit is...</i>

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:39.960
<i>there?</i>

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:41.470
<i>I'm really gonna sit </i>there<i>?</i>

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.180
Is something wrong?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.970
Sit down and make yourself at home.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:57.770
Sorry.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.050
N-No worries.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:03.200
Er, um... You sure have a lot of books, huh?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.950
You have lots in your room too, right?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.460
Um, I g-guess you're right...

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.210
<i>You might be right, but if you 
keep looking at me like that...</i>

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.710
<i>I'll turn bright red.</i>

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:35.580
Ayai?

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.690
I Want to Eat Your Pancreas

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.190
That book you wanted to read... 
Care to read it together?

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.190
I Want to Eat Your Pancreas

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.170
Ayai.

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:31.040
I should probably take you home now.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.290
Huh?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.220
Of course, I'd rather you stay.

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:38.100
But I'm sure your parents will start 
worrying if it gets any later.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.760
<i>We've been dating for six months now.</i>

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:51.020
<i>We've held hands before. 
We've even kissed before.</i>

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:55.020
<i>I thought we'd be ready 
to take the next step by now.</i>

00:04:55.020 --> 00:05:00.100
<i>Did Irido-kun invite me 
over just to hang out?</i>

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:05.190
<i>Was I the only one breathlessly 
worked up about it?</i>

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:07.860
I had fun today.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:10.200
Oh? Y-Yeah...

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.020
See you tomorrow at school, then.

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:29.110
I was all psyched up and ready 
when I invited her over, but...

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:32.810
I'm such a coward.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.960
We're third-years starting today, huh?

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:45.400
Do you think we'll be in the same class?

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.990
I'm not sure.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.450
We were in the same class 
last year, so who knows?

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:53.160
That's not the response I was looking for.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:53.960
Huh?

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:01.140
I hope we're in the same class this year too.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.220
<b>Class Roster</b>

