Girls

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:28.990
Arimura Dai 

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:28.990
Aita Nagako

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.340
I'm in Class 3...

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.250
<b>Monday, April 5th</b>

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:41.000
Class is no fun without you, Irido-kun.

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.950
Plus, there's no way I can make any friends.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.000
I'm alone all over again.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:52.010
But we can still meet up 
here after school every day.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.770
I know that, but...

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:58.760
I don't like not being able to spend 
as much time together anymore.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:01.740
I wanted to do school stuff with you.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:05.860
I wanted to enjoy my last year 
of middle school with you.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:09.280
We can still do couple 
stuff together, you know?

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.640
We'll have plenty of opportunities 
to make memories.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.390
Like when?

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:18.360
Like Christmas and Valentine's, for instance.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.670
Promise?

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:26.810
Promise.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:34.550
<b>Friday, April 9th</b>

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.000
Sorry I kept you waiting!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:39.430
No worries. I lost track of 
time reading anyway.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.300
But it's rare for you to be late.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:43.400
Something happen?

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.500
Well, actually...

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.570
I made a friend in my class!

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.280
You did?

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.970
Yup, I did!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.600
There was this girl reading a book at lunch,

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.700
so I plucked up the courage to 
talk to her and we really clicked.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.400
<i>You</i> approached <i>her</i>?

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.200
Yup!

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:04.960
Going out with you seems to have helped 
me overcome my social anxiety a little.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.460
Bond and Book:
 The Long Long Goodbye of 
"The Last Bookstore"

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.460
That so? Well, I'm glad you made a new friend.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.960
Oh, that's right.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:14.000
Let's see... It should be 
around here somewhere.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.470
You looking for something?

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.600
Yeah.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.970
The book my friend recommended to me!

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.730
Oh, there it is!

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.150
That book my friend recommended 
was so interesting!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.570
I've never read that genre before.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:35.530
Bond and Book: 
The Seven Dantes Who Condemn 
the Seven "Divine Comedies"

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:35.530
<b>Broadcast 
Minato Kanae</b>

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:35.050
Then my friend came over, right?

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:37.530
And she asked if I wanted
 to go to this café...

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.040
Irido

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:42.540
Want to go out somewhere this weekend?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:47.320
<i>Um... I'm sorry, but I already 
made plans with a friend.</i>

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:49.400
I see.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:09.640
There you are!

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.940
Irido-kun!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.270
I went to the library, but you weren't there.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:18.820
I'm sorry. One of my friends started 
talking to me, and I couldn't get away.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.840
I get it. It's fine.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:30.380
So, I was telling one of my friends 
about you earlier today...

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.350
Will you drop it already?

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:34.870
Huh?

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.760
I have no interest in 
hearing about your friends.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.520
Right. Of course.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.530
Irido

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.140
What's wrong with me?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.350
I'll apologize to her tomorrow for sure.

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.570
Hey, hey! Yume-chan!

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:16.550
Wanna grab a cup of tea 
on the way home?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.240
Sorry!

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.430
Can I take a rain check?

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:23.160
Huh?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.970
Have any recommendations?

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.960
For a book report? Let's see...

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.680
How about Mori Ogai?

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:32.190
Aren't his books kinda challenging?

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:36.320
I Am Blue, in Pain, 
and Fragile

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:35.210
I guess so. He does use some 
outdated language.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:39.320
I was kinda hoping for something 
easier to read, you know?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.450
Then how about Miyazawa Kenji?

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.450
Who's that?

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.660
There should be a chapter 
on his work in the textbook.

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.950
That's where I sit...

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:44.460
Oh, yeah!

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:46.520
It'd be easier to pick
 a story I've already read.

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:47.720
I'll go have a look for it!

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:49.280
Well, thanks a ton!

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.230
Sure.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.420
Ayai...

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.900
I'm sorry for being so mean to you yesterday.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:22.070
I can explain.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.240
It just felt like you were getting 
further and further away from me.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:33.790
Once you made friends, you started 
spending so much time with other people.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.720
I was happy for you at first. 
But then gradually...

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:42.130
I started wishing I could 
keep you all to myself.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.540
I'm really sorry.

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:47.140
I hope you can forgive me.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:50.740
So you don't like it when <i>I </i>
spend time with other people,

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:54.150
but it's okay for <i>you</i> 
to be with other girls?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:54.960
Huh?

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:58.760
You were talking to another 
girl just now, weren't you?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:02.030
You even let her sit in <i>my</i> seat!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:06.030
She needed help choosing a book, 
so I was just lending an ear.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:10.950
She's the girl you were secretly talking 
to the day I got here late, isn't she?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.580
This is the first time we've ever spoken.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.000
You're cheating, aren't you?!

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:16.380
Huh?

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:26.300
Do I really deserve to be berated 
with such baseless accusations?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.630
Why here?

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.270
How could you do something so heartless?

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:35.820
This is where we first met, isn't it?

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:39.260
How could you do it where we've 
made so many memories together?!

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:40.730
I'm telling you I didn't cheat!

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:45.670
Sorry.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.200
But I'm telling you the truth.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.000
<b>My Stepmom's Daughter Is My Ex</b>

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:06.170
<i>I now know that it was
 just a misunderstanding.</i>

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.480
<i>Even at the time, I probably 
knew that deep down.</i>

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:14.390
<i>Even so, the impression 
it left on me lingers.</i>

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.580
<i>The wound it carved into my heart remains.</i>

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:24.440
<i>"In a place full of shared memories, the 
person I trusted most betrayed that trust."</i>

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:32.120
<i>The mere thought of it tainted those
 memories as well as my feelings for him.</i>

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:41.050
<i>It had nothing to do with Ayai.</i>

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:45.130
<i>I was just acting out of a childish 
sense of pride and jealousy.</i>

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.140
<i>But still, I just couldn't stand it.</i>

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:53.220
<i>So, I was telling one of my friends 
about you earlier today...</i>

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.730
<i>I was convinced she was taking pity on me.</i>

00:13:56.990 --> 00:14:00.230
<i>And she was the last person I ever 
wanted to have treating me that way.</i>

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.050
<i>But looking back on it now,</i>

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:06.500
<i>I'm sure she was just trying to 
be considerate in her own way.</i>

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.760
<i>If the reason we grew 
apart was her making friends,</i>

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:14.270
<i>all I had to do was join her friend group
and it would've been fine.</i>

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.330
<i>I know that. I understood that.</i>

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:23.740
<i>I should have just bottled up my 
feelings and gone along with it.</i>

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.760
<i>I should've chosen my words more carefully.</i>

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:32.040
<i>Deep down... I knew that all along.</i>

