00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:00.570
Huh?

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.040
Didn't you want to read it?

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:07.010
You came to get this one too, didn't you?

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:11.010
I did, but... Thank you.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:14.760
<b>Tengaki Books</b>

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.720
Do you have time to talk?

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:18.730
Listen, I've been thinking.

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:22.650
It's not healthy to keep up
 so much friction between us.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.790
Don't you think we should try to make up?

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:28.400
It's just been awkward
 seeing each other at school.

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:31.750
I apologize for what happened 
in the library, okay?

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:35.640
Okay.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.340
<i>If I hadn't broken the silence,</i>

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:44.790
<i>how was Ayai planning
 on keeping up our relationship?</i>

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.800
<i>Why won't Irido-kun walk alongside me?</i>

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:57.080
<i>I even apologized after such 
a ludicrous accusation.</i>

00:15:57.080 --> 00:16:00.090
<i>So why hasn't she uttered 
one word of remorse to me?</i>

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:06.520
<i>And when the reconciliation 
is so superficial...</i>

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:11.780
<i>Have we... even really made up?</i>

