00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:55.020
<i>In the end, I couldn't bring 
myself to invite him.</i>

00:16:55.020 --> 00:16:59.910
<i>But since we'd reconciled, I thought 
he might just be there anyway.</i>

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:06.880
<i>That he would come find me, 
like he'd done the year before.</i>

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:09.450
<i>I hung tight to that naïve delusion.</i>

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.600
<i>I'd known this would happen.</i>

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:15.930
<i>Yet I still waited, clinging
 to a glimmer of hope.</i>

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:21.930
<i>It was silly of me to expect 
things to just work out like that.</i>

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.880
<i>If I had really wanted to reconcile,</i>

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:29.080
<i>I should have communicated 
that to him myself.</i>

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:36.580
<i>If only we hadn't had that fight, we could 
have come here together like last time.</i>

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:58.970
Saturday, August 28th

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.970
<i>This is our one-year anniversary, isn't it?</i>

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:01.190
<i>He won't even message me?</i>

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:03.540
<i>I waited all night.</i>

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:08.440
<i>And all summer break...</i>

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:11.670
<i>We haven't seen each other in over a month.</i>

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.960
Hey, could you grab that for me?

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:22.490
Culture Festival

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.170
Okay!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.490
Thanks! Almost got it.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.600
Oh, you're so right!

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:32.670
Take it!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.810
That'll look great.

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:36.010
Then we'll add this...

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:42.010
<b>The Metamorphosis</b>

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:45.220
That's awesome!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.510
Let's get a little closer!

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.830
Hey, look! Isn't it pretty?

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.800
Wow, you're right!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:26.190
I should have worn something warmer.

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:28.190
Here. You can wear my scarf.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.770
Won't you catch a cold?

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:47.950
<i>It's been a whole year since then, huh?</i>

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.920
Asking the streets:\h\h\h\h\hHow are you spending Christmas?!

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.920
In front of Kyoto Station

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.920
<i>So where are you two headed today?</i>

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.600
<i>Um...</i>

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.380
<i>We're out shopping to get 
each other a Christmas gift.</i>

00:19:58.380 --> 00:19:59.920
<i>How sweet!</i>

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:02.680
<i>You lovebirds! I'm so jealous!</i>

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.680
Asking the streets:\h\h\h\h\hHow are you spending Christmas?!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.680
In front of Kyoto Station

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.680
A twenty-something couple

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.680
<b>Where are you headed today?</b>

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:15.520
FriendlyMart's Original Chocolate Available Now

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.660
<b>Nagimi Middle School 
Graduation Ceremony</b>

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.060
Let's break up.

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:35.530
Yeah.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:43.110
<i>When both Christmas and Valentine's 
passed by without any contact,</i>

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:46.940
<i>I was certain we could never 
go back to the way things were.</i>

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:50.660
<i>So I broke up with her.</i>

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:56.660
<i>I realized feelings of love and 
hatred were at odds within me.</i>

00:20:59.620 --> 00:21:01.990
<i>And though they contradicted each other,</i>

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.640
<i>both my affection and resentment 
for her were undeniable.</i>

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.060
<i>A reality I couldn't ignore.</i>

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:10.970
<i>It was agony.</i>

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:13.510
<i>I was in pain.</i>

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:15.670
<i>I was miserable.</i>

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:22.010
<i>And the strife caused by those opposing 
emotions slowly ate away at me.</i>

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:26.040
<i>So it wasn't the end 
of a relationship for me.</i>

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:30.280
<i>It was a liberation.</i>

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.640
<i>And yet, not long after...</i>

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:44.900
Mizuto, this is Ayai Yume. 
She'll be your new sister.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:54.580
Irido

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:54.580
Hey, stop rummaging through my bookcase!

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:57.830
Why should I? I'm your sister, aren't I?

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.130
I Want to Eat Your Pancreas

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.130
I'm borrowing this.

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.760
That's the book we read together in this room.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:06.880
I Want to Eat Your Pancreas

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:08.120
Huh? Really?

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:13.660
As I recall, you said that was your 
first time in a guy's room, right?

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:17.330
I Want to Eat Your Pancreas

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:15.930
You must have been so full of lewd thoughts

00:22:15.930 --> 00:22:18.600
that the story went 
in one ear and out the other.

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:20.540
Th-That's not true!

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:24.480
<b>You're the One Who Started It</b>

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:23.480
Besides, wasn't it your idea to begin with?!

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:24.480
Huh?

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:28.620
You invited me over under the 
pretense that you'd be home alone!

00:22:28.620 --> 00:22:30.740
Then you had me sit on 
your bed of all places!

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:31.620
I Want to Eat Your Pancreas

00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:34.870
You totally planned on making 
a move, didn't you?

00:22:35.840 --> 00:22:37.370
Go ahead and laugh for all I care.

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:41.120
Laugh at the coward who ended up wimping out

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:44.250
after finally working up the 
resolve to invite you over.

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:46.590
What?!

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:49.160
Why are you surprised? 
It's just what you accused me of!

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:53.140
Wh-What's this about "resolve"?! 
You "wimped out" of <i>what</i> exactly?!

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:57.430
I came here that day 
completely ready for it!

00:22:57.430 --> 00:22:58.540
Huh?

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:03.550
Wait! I backed off because <i>you</i> 
seemed so apprehensive about it!

00:23:03.550 --> 00:23:06.570
You listen here! 
That was <i>nervous excitement</i>!

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:08.060
What?!

00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:11.490
Lies! You're telling me you were 
down for it the whole time?!

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:13.370
Of course I was!

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:17.040
I came here excited to make the 
memory of a lifetime with you!

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:19.040
R-Really?

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:23.410
So I spent ages plagued 
with regret for nothing...

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:24.780
That's my line!

00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:27.480
I wasted so much time 
convinced I was undesirable.

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:28.700
Give it back!

00:23:28.700 --> 00:23:29.850
Like I care!

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:32.080
It's your fault for looking frozen stiff!

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:33.850
No, it's your fault for wimping out.

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:35.010
You coward!
